    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate Gambar Carousel Pending\n\nManual: klik Execute Workflow.\nSetiap run memproses 1 baris status pending yang kolom image_urls-nya masih kosong (tab Carousel, sheet Knowledge Base).\nAlur: slide -> NVIDIA FLUX.1-schnell -> ImgBB -> isi kolom image_urls.\n\nCredential: Bearer Auth (API key NVIDIA) + ImgBB (Custom Auth, query key).\nNaikkan batas di node \"Batasi 1 Baris\" setelah uji coba berhasil.",
        "color": 4
      },
